# cw-opt: CleanWRT's own signed apk feed, for what the official OpenWrt repositories do not
# carry and the image leaves out to stay small: qBittorrent with its Qt6 stack
# (`apk add qbittorrent luci-app-qbittorrent`) and the Syncthing switch (`apk add syncthing
# luci-app-syncthing`). The index is signed with this project's key, which the image trusts
# (/etc/apk/keys/public-key.pem).
#
# Built and published by the `feed` workflow (tools/cw-publish-feed.sh) to the project site.
# The build workflow refuses to build an image while this URL does not answer: a dead feed
# entry would break `apk update` on every router.
https://shanelkapramuditha.github.io/cleanwrt-aw1000-ng/feed/packages.adb
